                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>How much does skincare photography cost per SKU?</h3>
                                        <p>Rs 1,200-4,000 per SKU top-tier for 12-shot + video + edit. Rs 700-1,500 basic. AED 180-500 in Dubai. Rs 200-500 marginal in-house.</p>
                                        <h3>What shots does every skincare SKU need?</h3>
                                        <p>Hero + labels + texture + swatch + on-model + lifestyle + ingredient + scale + before-after (compliance-safe) + routine flat-lay + 15-30 sec video + 60-90 sec tutorial. 12-shot spec.</p>
                                        <h3>Should we build an in-house skincare photography studio?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes at 50+ SKU / month sustained. Rs 8-18 lakh setup + Rs 200-500 marginal per SKU. Below 50/month, contracted studio + AI-augmented workflow more cost-efficient.</p>
                                        <h3>How do we do compliance-safe before-after photography?</h3>
                                        <p>Same person + same lighting + same angle + reasonable time-frame (2-8 weeks not "instant") + clinical/consumer study substantiation + disclaimer language + real consumer + no dramatic claims. See <a href="/resources/skincare_before_after_content_asci_esma.php">before-after compliance playbook</a>.</p>
                                        <h3>Can AI generate skincare photography?</h3>
                                        <p>AI-augmented workflow (canonical 3-5 shots + AI background swap + variant renders via Photoroom / Cloudinary) cuts cost 30-50% + speeds output 3-5x. Full AI-generated skincare photography unreliable for high-value + trust-critical shots.</p>
                                        <h3>How much video content does a skincare brand need per month?</h3>
                                        <p>15-30 sec on every SKU. 60-90 sec tutorial weekly. 3-5 min founder/derm deep-dive monthly. 8-15 Reels/week. Weekly Live Shopping. Rs 1.5-4 lakh/quarter budget.</p>
                                        <h3>Do we need a photographer specialist or can generic e-com photographer work?</h3>
                                        <p>Specialist for skincare. Texture + swatch + ingredient + result photography requires skincare-trained retoucher + macro lens + specific lighting. Specialist charges 30-70% premium but delivers 2-3x conversion lift.</p>
                                        <h3>How does ITD GrowthLabs handle skincare photography?</h3>
                                        <p>In-house pod for Growth-tier + Enterprise clients. Photographer + retoucher + video editor trained on skincare requirements. Batch workflow 100-300 SKUs / month. See <a href="/industries/digital-marketing-for-skincare-brands.php">skincare vertical page</a>.</p>
